WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:02.790
There's really no one best way for

00:02.790 --> 00:05.630
folks to eat a diet that's made up of

00:05.630 --> 00:08.030
predominantly plant based foods is

00:08.030 --> 00:10.197
probably what's going to work out best

00:10.197 --> 00:12.197
for most . Whether an individual is

00:12.197 --> 00:14.419
looking to lose weight , gain weight or

00:14.419 --> 00:16.474
maintain weight . A lot of times , a

00:16.474 --> 00:18.363
starting place is just even being

00:18.363 --> 00:20.141
mindful or aware of what you're

00:20.141 --> 00:22.363
consuming on a day to day basis . A lot

00:22.363 --> 00:24.086
of times we talk about fueling

00:24.086 --> 00:26.030
ourselves with predominantly water

00:26.030 --> 00:28.086
throughout the day , a good starting

00:28.086 --> 00:30.308
point is generally half our body weight

00:30.308 --> 00:32.474
and fluid ounces . So for example , if

00:32.474 --> 00:34.697
we wait 100 and six , You're looking at

00:34.697 --> 00:36.697
about 80 oz as a starting point for

00:36.697 --> 00:38.808
where we should begin looking to meet

00:38.808 --> 00:40.060
our hydration needs throughout the day .

